aram ('Setubandha', vulgate 6.126 only)<br/><b>confidence</b>: low<br/><b>alternative</b>: True]]></description><Point><coordinates>79.31730,9.28810,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Setu: Indian end — alternative: Thiruppullani / Darbhasayanam (mainland tradition)</name><styleUrl>#low</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>name</b>: Setu: Indian end — alternative: Thiruppullani / Darbhasayanam (mainland tradition)<br/><b>confidence</b>: low<br/><b>alternative</b>: True]]></description><Point><coordinates>78.82440,9.28270,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Setu: Indian end — alternative: Devipattinam / Navapashanam (mainland tradition)</name><styleUrl>#low</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>name</b>: Setu: Indian end — alternative: Devipattinam / Navapashanam (mainland tradition)<br/><b>confidence</b>: low<br/><b>alternative</b>: True]]></description><Point><coordinates>78.89340,9.47190,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Setu: Indian end — alternative: Kodiakkarai Ramar Padam (Point Calimere tradition)</name><styleUrl>#low</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>name</b>: Setu: Indian end — alternative: Kodiakkarai Ramar Padam (Point Calimere tradition)<br/><b>confidence</b>: low<br/><b>alternative</b>: True]]></description><Point><coordinates>79.84240,10.33200,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Setu: Lanka end</name><styleUrl>#high</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>name</b>: Setu: Lanka end<br/><b>short</b>: Setu (Talaimannar)<br/><b>sanskrit</b>: सेतु<br/><b>valmiki_refs</b>: 6.22.70 (vulgate: 'up to Suvela'; absent CE)<br/><b>text_clue</b>: The causeway reaches the far shore<br/><b>identification</b>: Talaimannar, west tip of Mannar island: eastern end of Adam's Bridge<br/><b>confidence</b>: high<br/><b>coord_source</b>: OpenStreetMap; pier 9.1087, 79.7303<br/><b>coastal</b>: True<br/><b>route_order</b>: 15<br/><b>on_overview</b>: True<br/><b>on_lanka_map</b>: True<br/><b>label_dx</b>: 0.3<br/><b>label_